  "description": "While watching the famous Serengeti “Three Colors” sunset at a bar, Ian, a former military soldier, met Lucy, a man who looked somewhat familiar. Ian was swept away by his charm, and invited Lucy to his room.\n\nI feel comfortable with Lucy’s beautiful smile and gentle touch, but can I do it with a man that I just met three hours ago? Maybe... \n\n*“Are you going to put it in me?”*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
